WEBVTT

00:04.840 --> 00:06.740
The spring's been restored?

00:06.740 --> 00:07.960
That's great.

00:07.960 --> 00:11.320
Yeah. For a moment, I was
worried what would happen.

00:11.630 --> 00:13.580
They were able to defeat them.

00:13.580 --> 00:15.700
They're reliable girls, right?

00:17.740 --> 00:19.700
It's painful to watch.

00:20.310 --> 00:22.500
Are they not the chosen ones?

00:23.020 --> 00:25.710
I want to make sure of that next time.

00:32.800 --> 00:35.020
There were stars there.

00:35.830 --> 00:39.770
The gods created people in their own image.

00:40.790 --> 00:45.980
The gods granted people
wisdom like their own.

00:47.810 --> 00:52.230
The people who shared
one apple were blessed,

00:52.230 --> 00:55.400
and led to further apples.

00:56.210 --> 01:00.460
Those unable to share one
apple were punished.

01:01.030 --> 01:06.170
Soon, all will be returned to nothing
under the name of the Demiurge.

02:29.560 --> 02:32.960
It's Definitely a Shock!

02:33.340 --> 02:34.960
Cheers!

02:52.100 --> 02:54.270
Don't rush yourselves.
There's enough for seconds.

02:54.270 --> 02:55.260
Seconds!

02:57.950 --> 02:59.190
Okay, okay.

03:01.180 --> 03:03.500
It's been so long since
we were last in Haruna.

03:04.430 --> 03:08.060
Have you heard anything about
my brother while I was gone?

03:08.060 --> 03:09.500
He hasn't come back.

03:10.690 --> 03:12.100
There's no news either.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.290
I see.

03:14.940 --> 03:17.000
Leviatan, cheer up.

03:17.000 --> 03:20.750
It's been a while since you've had
your beloved barley tea, right?

03:20.750 --> 03:22.760
Come on, drink up.

03:22.760 --> 03:23.840
O-Okay.

03:24.390 --> 03:27.100
At any rate, that was a long vacation.

03:27.600 --> 03:30.850
My father must be very worried.

03:31.030 --> 03:33.410
It was a good job for me.

03:33.410 --> 03:35.150
Not that I'm done yet, though.

03:35.320 --> 03:37.080
What? Why not?

03:37.080 --> 03:39.120
You're still on vacation
until you get home, right?

03:39.120 --> 03:40.230
What?

03:40.230 --> 03:42.910
So, you'll be paying for this, too, right?

03:44.040 --> 03:45.870
Mu-chan, thanks for the food!

03:46.860 --> 03:48.040
Thank you.

03:48.260 --> 03:49.040
What?

03:49.180 --> 03:51.440
Does that mean we can order more?

03:51.440 --> 03:52.160
Yeah.

03:52.160 --> 03:53.870
I'll have a kid's meal.

03:53.870 --> 03:54.800
Me, too.

03:54.800 --> 03:56.040
I'll have an extra large serving.

03:57.810 --> 04:00.300
Fine, do whatever you want.

04:00.500 --> 04:02.020
All right!

04:02.020 --> 04:04.010
Oh, I will!

04:06.830 --> 04:10.610
This was a rewarding journey.

04:12.280 --> 04:16.560
I'm happy to say it was an
appropriate training camp...

04:16.560 --> 04:18.020
...for the Aquafall Defense.

04:18.590 --> 04:20.530
Good work, everyone.

04:23.390 --> 04:26.880
Your strength has grown beyond recognition,

04:26.880 --> 04:29.170
and your teamwork has improved, as well.

04:29.590 --> 04:32.310
Now we can protect this
planet with confidence.

04:33.200 --> 04:35.330
Now, let me ask you again...

04:35.580 --> 04:39.000
Will you join the Aquafall Defense?

04:39.000 --> 04:40.710
Sure!

04:40.710 --> 04:43.810
Huh? You're too young to join.

04:44.150 --> 04:46.760
I'll work hard for every one of you.

04:47.110 --> 04:48.330
What?

04:48.330 --> 04:49.630
Oh, right.

04:49.630 --> 04:51.180
Jörm, you can do it!

04:51.180 --> 04:51.990
Yeah.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.560
It's decided, then.

04:55.910 --> 04:59.410
Well, I suppose I'd be willing to join.

05:00.650 --> 05:02.690
I've been waiting to hear you say that!

05:02.690 --> 05:03.940
Thank you!

05:04.520 --> 05:07.110
Okay, Mu-chan's induction is decided, as well.

05:07.110 --> 05:09.450
Finally, let me ask you...

05:09.450 --> 05:11.910
Leviatan, will you join us?

05:14.840 --> 05:18.290
No. I want to stay here in town.

05:18.290 --> 05:19.510
What?

05:20.220 --> 05:22.150
Huh? What are you taking about?

05:22.150 --> 05:25.170
You've evolved, but you're
going to think about it?

05:30.220 --> 05:32.470
You're the only one who returned?

05:32.990 --> 05:34.380
What happened to the others?

05:36.700 --> 05:38.980
What happened? Tell me.

05:41.300 --> 05:45.940
The meteorite was a Lucasite,
just as we suspected.

05:47.210 --> 05:49.200
It's unbelievably huge.

05:50.150 --> 05:54.140
The nearby town of Ulrey has
already been destroyed.

05:55.600 --> 06:00.110
Knowing we needed to inform you of the situation immediately, on our return...

06:00.810 --> 06:01.840
Keep it together.

06:04.880 --> 06:07.230
What about the Lucasite?

06:07.870 --> 06:10.760
It will come this way soon.

06:12.890 --> 06:14.310
We should strengthen our defenses.

06:14.630 --> 06:16.710
What shall we do with the people in town?

06:16.710 --> 06:19.680
We must determine the
Lucasite's location first.

06:20.070 --> 06:20.910
You're right.

06:21.300 --> 06:24.220
Wyvern, can you scout the area?

06:24.530 --> 06:26.380
Yes, understood.

06:33.850 --> 06:37.000
The marshal. What could it be?

06:38.900 --> 06:41.620
He must be reporting to father.

06:42.090 --> 06:45.530
I wonder if he knows I went to the
villa without saying anything.

06:46.220 --> 06:48.550
I'm sure he'll forgive me.

06:52.110 --> 06:56.490
Welcome home, miss. When did you return?

06:56.490 --> 06:59.140
Just now. Has something happened?

06:59.490 --> 07:01.970
It's an emergency. The truth is...

07:02.920 --> 07:04.580
A Lucasite?

07:05.530 --> 07:07.770
We just defeated one.

07:08.410 --> 07:10.490
But I'm a member of
the Aquafall Defense.

07:10.490 --> 07:13.870
I'll defeat the Lucasite and show
my father just how strong I am.

07:15.510 --> 07:18.410
If I could use powerful magic...

07:19.210 --> 07:23.120
I know! My father has magic tomes
in his library, doesn't he?

07:25.390 --> 07:28.990
"Being a Mage," "Encyclopedia of Clans,"

07:28.990 --> 07:30.720
"A Complete History of Aquafall..."

07:31.030 --> 07:35.860
"Seasonal Poems of Magic,"
"Magic Gourmet A~Z..."

07:35.860 --> 07:37.470
There's nothing useful here.

07:39.870 --> 07:44.390
Could he be hiding some
forbidden grimoire?

07:47.210 --> 07:49.530
Is this father's secret diary?

07:49.780 --> 07:51.970
I shouldn't look at this.

07:56.830 --> 07:59.990
Just a little. I'll only look a little bit.

07:59.990 --> 08:02.930
Father, a father and
daughter mustn't keep

08:02.930 --> 08:04.490
secrets from each other.

08:05.590 --> 08:07.600
What's this?

08:07.600 --> 08:11.270
"I am unsure if I should write this,

08:11.270 --> 08:14.430
but I have decided to do
so for my beloved late wife,

08:14.430 --> 08:18.850
and the important memories
I share with her."

08:19.080 --> 08:20.600
Mother.

08:22.580 --> 08:25.230
My wife and I met under
strange circumstances.

08:26.780 --> 08:29.650
That night, amidst a raging storm,

08:30.070 --> 08:33.870
my wife arrived in front of my
home carrying a infant with her.

08:38.090 --> 08:40.190
My wife's name was Eceus Ratra.

08:40.600 --> 08:42.810
The child's name was Bahamut.

08:43.380 --> 08:47.880
Now she is a keepsake of my
wife and my beloved daughter.

08:53.570 --> 08:57.180
I'm not my father's child?

08:59.900 --> 09:03.680
Why hasn't Bahamut returned yet?

09:04.470 --> 09:06.360
Did something happen to her?

09:06.750 --> 09:08.190
Has Bahamut returned?

09:08.620 --> 09:11.690
Your daughter came home
just a moment ago.

09:11.690 --> 09:14.570
I-I see. Good.

09:14.570 --> 09:18.400
I must tell Bahamut
danger is approaching.

09:19.050 --> 09:21.330
She should be in the library.

09:21.660 --> 09:23.370
I see. Thank you.

09:27.940 --> 09:29.540
Welcome home, Bahamut.

09:30.230 --> 09:31.330
Are you there?

09:40.190 --> 09:41.290
No...

09:43.640 --> 09:46.620
I had to tell her eventually...

10:20.140 --> 10:21.880
What is this place?

10:22.200 --> 10:23.370
Levi.

10:24.460 --> 10:25.670
Onii-chan.

10:28.650 --> 10:31.490
I miss you. Where are you, Onii-chan?

10:31.850 --> 10:32.970
Come home!

10:32.970 --> 10:33.780
Levi.

10:35.090 --> 10:37.250
You must go on a journey
to protect Aquafall.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.190
Go with the fairy.

10:39.580 --> 10:44.370
Why? I want to wait here
for you to come home.

10:44.600 --> 10:47.890
I want to stay here in town and protect it.

10:48.160 --> 10:49.170
Thank you,

10:49.700 --> 10:54.380
but protecting the planet is the same as protecting the town of Haruna.

10:56.450 --> 10:59.580
So long as the Eibolias are
not completely destroyed,

10:59.580 --> 11:01.360
their threat will never leave the planet.

11:01.880 --> 11:06.860
Just as the fairy says, at this
rate, all life will be destroyed.

11:08.080 --> 11:09.820
Eibolias?

11:09.820 --> 11:11.440
Those monsters.

11:13.750 --> 11:16.460
Is something so terrible
really happening?

11:16.460 --> 11:18.850
Do you mean there are more
Lucasites like the ones we...

11:18.850 --> 11:20.150
...encountered at the ocean and the ruins?

11:22.250 --> 11:24.910
Levi, you have to protect the planet.

11:25.670 --> 11:26.920
Me?

11:28.270 --> 11:31.030
I don't have the strength.

11:31.030 --> 11:32.610
You cannot do it alone.

11:33.120 --> 11:35.330
But you are the only one who can do it.

11:36.090 --> 11:37.960
With your spear in hand,

11:37.960 --> 11:40.490
you must protect this planet
and all its living creatures.

11:45.570 --> 11:46.680
Onii-chan!

11:50.050 --> 11:52.940
Leviatan, are you okay? It's morning.

11:53.250 --> 11:54.950
You were moaning in your sleep.

11:54.950 --> 11:56.620
Did you have a bad dream?

11:59.050 --> 12:01.450
No, it was nothing.

12:02.240 --> 12:04.580
You saw an embarrassing side of me.

12:05.020 --> 12:06.880
Good morning!

12:09.250 --> 12:11.170
Jörm, good morning.

12:11.170 --> 12:12.300
What's going on?

12:12.300 --> 12:13.980
Do you have deliveries this morning?

12:13.980 --> 12:16.290
I've got those, too, but...

12:16.290 --> 12:18.030
It's fine.

12:18.030 --> 12:19.350
It's no exaggeration to call this...

12:19.350 --> 12:21.140
...place the headquarters
of the Aquafall Defense—

12:21.140 --> 12:22.050
It is an exaggeration.

12:23.820 --> 12:27.470
Levi-tan, have you decided to
join the Aquafall Defense?

12:27.470 --> 12:28.290
What?

12:31.250 --> 12:35.230
My brother told in a dream to
go on a journey with the fairy.

12:35.490 --> 12:36.430
Really?

12:36.430 --> 12:39.830
I knew your brother would understand.

12:39.830 --> 12:42.440
He's so wonderful!
Not that I've ever met him...

12:42.440 --> 12:43.650
It's decided, then!

12:45.620 --> 12:46.550
Well...

12:46.550 --> 12:48.240
You still can't make up your mind?

12:48.240 --> 12:50.950
Your beloved brother told you to do it.

12:50.950 --> 12:53.170
There's no reason to
worry about it any more.

12:56.550 --> 12:58.660
Now that I think of it, I'm hungry.

12:58.660 --> 12:59.420
Yeah.

13:00.260 --> 13:03.100
Let's have breakfast at
Bahamut's place, then.

13:07.340 --> 13:09.560
Mu-chan!

13:13.790 --> 13:15.140
Who are you?

13:15.340 --> 13:17.140
We're Mu-chan's friends.

13:17.140 --> 13:18.900
We're here to eat breakfast.

13:19.590 --> 13:20.660
Mu-chan?

13:21.360 --> 13:24.320
Good morning. Is Bahamut here?

13:24.930 --> 13:28.550
Actually, she has been
missing since last night.

13:28.550 --> 13:31.240
The master is very worried, as well.

13:31.840 --> 13:34.000
Bahamut's missing?

13:34.000 --> 13:34.960
What happened to her?

13:36.090 --> 13:38.130
I don't know.

13:40.120 --> 13:41.770
Let's look for her.

13:41.770 --> 13:42.570
Yeah.

13:43.440 --> 13:45.570
Where could she have gone
at a time like this?

13:46.160 --> 13:49.760
The town isn't that large.
We'll find her soon.

13:49.760 --> 13:52.180
What about the reconnaissance mission?

13:52.180 --> 13:54.340
Has Wyvern still not returned?

13:54.340 --> 13:57.550
I understand you're anxious,
but you need to calm down.

13:57.550 --> 13:59.020
How can I be calm?

13:59.430 --> 14:03.270
A Lucasite is approaching,
and my daughter is missing!

14:03.700 --> 14:05.210
I've had enough of this.

14:05.210 --> 14:06.400
I'm going to look for her.

14:06.600 --> 14:08.500
You must stay here!

14:09.090 --> 14:11.840
Let the others look for her.

14:11.840 --> 14:12.910
But...

14:13.110 --> 14:18.720
If Wyvern hasn't returned by
noon, we'll send out Cockatrice.

14:21.660 --> 14:23.250
She hasn't been here today.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.920
Did something happen?

14:24.920 --> 14:26.330
Uh, no.

14:26.330 --> 14:27.590
Let's try somewhere else.

14:28.380 --> 14:29.390
Yeah.

14:48.340 --> 14:51.500
What should I do?

14:52.270 --> 14:53.870
Father!

15:05.490 --> 15:07.050
We found her!

15:11.410 --> 15:13.550
Wh-What are you all doing here?

15:13.550 --> 15:15.130
Don't give us that.

15:15.130 --> 15:18.570
We were looking for you
since you disappeared.

15:18.570 --> 15:19.820
Oh, really?

15:19.820 --> 15:23.020
I was just enjoying the scenery here.

15:23.560 --> 15:26.780
Really? Have you been enjoying
it since last night?

15:28.960 --> 15:30.830
What happened, Bahamut?

15:31.300 --> 15:33.940
Why don't you tell us?

15:33.940 --> 15:35.280
Nothing happened.

15:35.700 --> 15:37.260
Well, then.

15:37.260 --> 15:39.960
Maybe I'll have some
pudding at the Key Tail.

15:39.960 --> 15:43.170
We still haven't had breakfast. Let's go.

15:43.170 --> 15:46.180
I want to go by myself. Don't follow me!

15:46.180 --> 15:46.880
What?

15:46.880 --> 15:50.630
Oh, and by the way,
I'm quitting the Aquafall Defense.

15:50.630 --> 15:53.390
What? But you just joined yesterday.

15:53.810 --> 15:57.080
Thanks for helping me kill some
time for the last few days.

15:57.370 --> 15:58.920
Well, see you later.

15:59.420 --> 16:00.550
Mu-chan!

16:01.290 --> 16:02.960
Something must have happened.

16:02.960 --> 16:04.520
I'll try asking her.

16:04.520 --> 16:06.300
You two wait here.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.740
That was a surprise.

16:13.110 --> 16:14.900
They suddenly showed up.

16:14.900 --> 16:17.310
I was so panicked, I might have
said something I shouldn't have...

16:18.260 --> 16:20.230
Bahamut, what happened?

16:20.230 --> 16:21.250
Syrorin!

16:21.250 --> 16:22.510
Syrop!

16:22.510 --> 16:26.560
You refuse to stop calling me that, no matter how many times I tell you not to!

16:28.660 --> 16:30.300
Sorry, Syrop.

16:30.540 --> 16:34.340
Huh? Oh, well...

16:37.470 --> 16:40.800
Listen, Bahamut, why don't
you tell me what's wrong?

16:41.290 --> 16:43.530
I know we haven't know each other
long, but aren't we friends?

16:43.530 --> 16:46.310
Is it all right for me to say
that? I thought we were.

16:46.880 --> 16:52.280
We laughed together, got mad
together, and fought together.

16:52.960 --> 16:55.830
As the captain of the Aquafall Defense,

16:55.830 --> 16:57.510
taking care of the mental well-being...

16:57.510 --> 16:59.580
...of my members is an
important responsibility.

16:59.940 --> 17:02.140
So, why don't you talk to me?

17:05.920 --> 17:08.690
The truth is...

17:09.860 --> 17:12.170
My father isn't my real father.

17:12.500 --> 17:13.410
Huh?

17:13.410 --> 17:17.050
Last night, I found that
written in a diary...

17:17.050 --> 17:19.660
What? Hold on, what are
you talking about?

17:19.660 --> 17:20.680
Is it true?

17:21.660 --> 17:24.620
I've been acting like...

17:24.620 --> 17:27.690
...a spoiled little princess because
my father was an important man.

17:28.300 --> 17:31.050
My father was always kind to me.

17:31.050 --> 17:34.470
He was really happy when
I used magic well.

17:35.180 --> 17:39.200
I'd been practicing secretly so
my father would praise me more.

17:40.420 --> 17:44.160
But he's not my father...

17:45.100 --> 17:46.580
I see.

17:47.520 --> 17:48.680
I...

17:50.390 --> 17:52.870
I don't have anything
to protect anymore...

17:55.690 --> 17:58.680
That's why you said you
quit the Aquafall Defense.

17:58.960 --> 18:03.880
And I can't fight when I'm feeling like this.

18:03.880 --> 18:06.690
Even though the Lucasite's
headed this way...

18:08.220 --> 18:11.110
What are you talking
about? What Lucasite?

18:15.050 --> 18:16.220
Look over there!

18:49.160 --> 18:52.940
That's the Lucasite we
encountered at the ocean!

20:11.580 --> 20:19.380
Next Episode

20:14.540 --> 20:19.380
I'll Definitely Defend It!
